t not brown. Add breadcrumbs and sugar and stir to combine. Incorporate 4 tbsp sugar, 3.3 tbsp butter, 6.7 tbsp breadcrumbs, 3.3 tbsp sugar, and 0.75 cup double cream smoothly until evenly distributed."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Dip & Coat Evenly"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Slowly toast the mixture as you stir with a spatula. Do not heat the mixture for too long – it only takes a short time to make. Once the breadcrumbs are lightly golden, remove from the pan and cool on a sheet of baking paper. Assembling the apple trifle:."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Dip & Coat Evenly"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Do not assemble the trifle until right before serving. Otherwise, the rasp will become soggy. Serve the trifle in individual small glasses or a large glass bowl. Lightly whip the double cream. Layer the ingredients in the glasses or bowl, starting with breadcrumbs in the bottom, followed by chilled apple sauce and breadcrumbs again. You can make several layers of breadcrumbs and apple sauce, then top with a generous layer of whipped cream. Serve immediately."}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","mochi-donuts",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/strawberry-glazed-mochi-donuts/","children":"Strawberry Glazed Mochi Donuts"}]}],["$","li","crispy-caramel-croffle",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/crispy-caramel-croffle/","children":"Crispy Caramel Croissant Waffle (Croffle)"}]}],["$","li","viral-3",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/crispy-cinnamon-sugar-churros-choc-dip/","children":"Crispy Cinnamon Sugar Churros & Choc Dip"}]}],["$","li","viral-10",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/matcha-white-choc-custard-taiyaki/","children":"Matcha White-Choc Custard Taiyaki"}]}],["$","li","viral-20",{"children":"$L13"}],"$L14"]}]]}]}]
